            "is_free": false,
            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game recreates a wide variety of real-life parking and parking-exit situations. Some of these scenarios are common, while others may challenge your imagination. In any case, I can assure you that every scenario is inspired by real life. If you are confident in your driving skills, this game is definitely worth a challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you will drive a designated vehicle, navigate around various obstacles, and finally park in the assigned space to complete the level. Sounds simple, doesn't it?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers two control modes. The first is an Easy Mode, where you can control movement and steering using only the four directional keys. The second is a Simulation Mode, where the steering does not automatically return to center, and throttle input can be adjusted precisely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background of the Game's Creation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was inspired by something we all face every day: parking. Sometimes we find perfectly designed parking spaces that are easy to use, but more often we encounter difficult, awkward, or even frustrating situations. However, frustration alone solves nothing. What truly matters is improving our judgment and decision-making skills. Every parking and parking-exit scenario in this game comes directly from real life. I transformed these situations into dozens of levels so that you can practice and challenge yourself freely in a virtual environment without any real-world consequences. I believe this experience can help improve your parking judgment. By continuing to challenge yourself, you'll gain a deeper understanding of driving and become more confident when facing all kinds of parking situations. I wish you smooth parking every day!</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game recreates a wide variety of real-life parking and parking-exit situations. Some of these scenarios are common, while others may challenge your imagination. In any case, I can assure you that every scenario is inspired by real life. If you are confident in your driving skills, this game is definitely worth a challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you will drive a designated vehicle, navigate around various obstacles, and finally park in the assigned space to complete the level. Sounds simple, doesn't it?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers two control modes. The first is an Easy Mode, where you can control movement and steering using only the four directional keys. The second is a Simulation Mode, where the steering does not automatically return to center, and throttle input can be adjusted precisely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background of the Game's Creation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was inspired by something we all face every day: parking. Sometimes we find perfectly designed parking spaces that are easy to use, but more often we encounter difficult, awkward, or even frustrating situations. However, frustration alone solves nothing. What truly matters is improving our judgment and decision-making skills. Every parking and parking-exit scenario in this game comes directly from real life. I transformed these situations into dozens of levels so that you can practice and challenge yourself freely in a virtual environment without any real-world consequences. I believe this experience can help improve your parking judgment. By continuing to challenge yourself, you'll gain a deeper understanding of driving and become more confident when facing all kinds of parking situations. I wish you smooth parking every day!</p>",
            "short_description": "Are you confident in your driving skills? Then come and take on this challenge. The goal is simple: drive the vehicle and park it in the designated space. That's all there is to it.",
